  "bodyHash": "f4797a90ef9e2f3b",
  "content": "\n\n<h1><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">F</span><span style=\"color:#bfedd2\">a</span><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">n</span><span style=\"color:#3598db\">c</span><span style=\"color:#169179\">y</span> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">T</span><span style=\"color:#34495e\">r</span><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">a</span><span style=\"color:#f8cac6\">i</span><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">l</span></strong> With Epic Fight</h1>\n<p>這是一個提供多種光影類型的劍刃揮砍模組。</p>\n<p>因此你需要：</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight - Minecraft 模組 - CurseForge</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guhaos-vix\" rel=\"nofollow\">GUHAO's VIX - Minecraft 模組 - CurseForge</a></p>\n<h1>如何使用？</h1>\n<p>當您建立動畫的 <em>data</em> 或 <em>item_skin</em> 時，您需要寫入</p>\n<p><em>data</em>：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_771e8e0b-561c-4de4-b8bc-dc5b71019f9c.PNG\"></p>\n<p>或</p>\n<p><em>item_skin</em>：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0cb7410f-1e06-475b-9e71-a3e5436e6827.PNG\"></p>\n<p>接著，您只需要將</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"particle_type\": \"epicfight:swing_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<p>放入</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"particle_type\": \"fancy:......\"</pre>\n</div>\n<p>以下是一些類型：</p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:bloom_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_b8536ec4-289a-4299-b3e2-df923304ec93.gif\"></p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:chromatic_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_e103cc48-3807-4e79-95b5-5828bd146540.gif\"></p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:air_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_379db6f4-db0e-49e9-9132-7d19361aa1d3.gif\"></p>\n<p>或稱為熱浪&uarr;</p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:space_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_1679d188-8228-434f-a016-3fb3605ad806.gif\"></p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:rgb_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_61dd70d2-12a5-4603-9169-2345c5e1c5bf.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<pre>fancy_trail:starry_trail</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_9e3440ed-e0b5-4e04-980a-efcbf8e7cbf7.gif\"></p>\n<p>&uarr;就像 Avaritia 模組一樣</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">&nbsp;請注意，它包含一個客戶端設定檔！！！</span></strong></p>\n<p>您可以同時使用多種，並搭配不同的材質。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">謝謝你，東非大野豬！</span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>1.1.0 版本：</p>\n<p>1. Flow 系列：</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_bloom_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_space_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_air_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_chromatic_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_rgb_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"flowing_starry_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_7b4b4b9a-96ad-4b77-bfba-57b84ecaf47f.gif\"></p>\n<p><strong>&uarr;這些並非直接套用光影，而是對渲染進行編碼修改。</strong></p>\n<p>2.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1380365/description_33916c03-736a-4bb0-869e-b21877710be2.gif\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"fire_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<p>當您的武器附帶火焰附魔時，您可以看到飛舞的火焰。</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"burst_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<p>&uarr;僅為簡單的濺射效果。</p>\n<p>1.1.2：<br>新增光影效果：</p>\n<div>\n<pre>\"fancy_trail:after_image_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n<div>\n<pre>\"fancy_trail:flowing_after_image_trail\"</pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
